{"title":"Leveling Up, By Only Eating!","synopsis":"Karakter utama terserang oleh kondisi langka yang hanya mempengaruhi dua orang di seluruh dunia defisiensi bulimia\nkondisi semacam gangguan jiwa dimana suka makan tapi gak mau gemuk pokoknya setelah makan dia sengaja muntahkan makanannya nah hal ini bisa mengancam jiwanya susah diterapinya\nDia mengatur makanan hariannya untuk bertahan hidup tetapi harapannya untuk bertahan hidup semakin redup seiring berjalannya waktu\nDia berkonsultasi dengan seorang dokter yang menyarankan bermain Reality Game Alternatif Athena  di mana dia bisa makan seperti yang dia inginkan tanpa menambah berat badan\nDia memainkan permainan untuk menyelamatkan hidupnya dan tumbuh dalam kekuatan dengan melakukan apaapa selain makan\nKehidupan Fantasi Gourmet","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"Koge, Park Min Gyu","artist":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Game"],"chapters":[{"id":"ed50a9a0-131f-4369-b835-3cc72a385c94","number":"208","title":"Chapter 208","date":"2025-12-05","images":[]},{"id":"25b495ab-47e9-4d12-a6cc-caf718322c99","number":"207","title":"Chapter 207","date":"2025-12-04","images":[]},{"id":"26153c4e-c4cf-49fc-b2d2-a71b16785db8","number":"206","title":"Chapter 206","date":"2025-12-04","images":[]},{"id":"5fbcfc1c-1b71-4f2e-a526-1800a081cb31","number":"205","title":"Chapter 205","date":"2025-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"1116c316-6858-4a4d-ad82-47c427d179f9","number":"204","title":"Chapter 204","date":"2025-11-30","images":[]},{"id":"1c948d65-0526-405a-b745-0d67e1de1dd3","number":"203","title":"Chapter 203","date":"2025-11-29","images":[]},{"id":"3bdcc6a3-1e53-4781-a4ec-4908f9a964c9","number":"202","title":"Chapter 202","date":"2025-11-20","images":[]},{"id":"123bb1cc-babb-4f65-83bc-42df2a1edc07","number":"201","title":"Chapter 201","date":"2025-11-20","images":[]},{"id":"2594e21b-42d6-4aae-9b00-9802080879ec","number":"200","title":"Chapter 200","date":"2025-05-31","images":[]},{"id":"236efa54-8cc6-435f-a28